      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-07-25T13:54:31.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Unfortunately, both of those cons are inopportunely timed for us. <a href=\"http://geekkon.net/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Geek.Kon</a> is the weekend after <a href=\"http://prime.paxsite.com/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">PAX Prime</a>, and <a href=\"http://www.ucon-gaming.org/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">U-Con</a> is the weekend after <a href=\"http://www.merz-verlag.com/spiel/e000.php4\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Spiel</a> in Essen (in Germany!), so there’s no way we could manage to go to all of them, and we’re already locked in for both PAX and Essen. Sorry! We wish we could be everywhere!</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
