      "raw": "Unfortunately, both of those cons are inopportunely timed for us. [url=http://geekkon.net/]Geek.Kon[/url] is the weekend after [url=http://prime.paxsite.com/]PAX Prime[/url], and [url=http://www.ucon-gaming.org/]U-Con[/url] is the weekend after [url=http://www.merz-verlag.com/spiel/e000.php4]Spiel[/url] in Essen (in Germany!), so there's no way we could manage to go to all of them, and we're already locked in for both PAX and Essen. Sorry! We wish we could be everywhere!",
