      "created_at": "2012-07-25T14:31:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just a thought, gina, but you and other folks going to those cons could work with the organizers to create your own events, demos, etc. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> There have been some other fans of the game who have done similar things that have worked out fairly well.</p>\n<p>Best wishes!</p>",
